    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Python代码不是机器码，CPU又不认识Python，为什么还能运行？",
      "audio": "s01.mp3",
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 7.2,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 216,
      "dur_sec": 7.2
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "因为它不是直接交给CPU，而是先经过Python解释器。",
      "audio": "s02.mp3",
      "start_sec": 7.36,
      "end_sec": 12.96,
      "start_frame": 221,
      "end_frame": 389,
      "dur_sec": 5.6
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "源码先被处理，通常会编译成字节码，再交给Python运行时执行。",
      "audio": "s03.mp3",
      "start_sec": 13.12,
      "end_sec": 19.52,
      "start_frame": 394,
      "end_frame": 586,
      "dur_sec": 6.4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "所以Python不是完全没有编译，而是编译和执行方式不同。",
      "audio": "s04.mp3",
      "start_sec": 19.68,
      "end_sec": 25.48,
      "start_frame": 590,
      "end_frame": 764,
      "dur_sec": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "比如这句 print Hello，会先变成一组字节码指令。",
      "audio": "s05.mp3",
      "start_sec": 25.64,
      "end_sec": 31.44,
      "start_frame": 769,
      "end_frame": 943,
      "dur_sec": 5.8
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "运行时一条条取出指令，管理对象、变量和调用。",
      "audio": "s06.mp3",
      "start_sec": 31.6,
      "end_sec": 36.0,
      "start_frame": 948,
      "end_frame": 1080,
      "dur_sec": 4.4
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "C语言通常先编译成机器码，再交给CPU；Python则由解释器和运行时参与执行。",
      "audio": "s07.mp3",
      "start_sec": 36.16,
      "end_sec": 44.16,
      "start_frame": 1085,
      "end_frame": 1325,
      "dur_sec": 8.0
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "CPU不认识Python，它执行的是运行环境里的机器指令。",
      "audio": "s08.mp3",
      "start_sec": 44.32,
      "end_sec": 50.12,
